WEBVTT

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.090
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:07.790
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:11.070
Finally, the character everyone has been waiting for has returned!

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.360
And that is not all...

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:14.520
Yeah, yeah!

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.580
Amulet Heart's new item also makes its appearance!

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.140
I have a feeling today's episode will be super exciting!

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.330
Doki!

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.360
Pyon Pyon

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.520
Fumu Fumu

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:34.430
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:36.030
Howa Howa

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:37.230
Kira Kira

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:38.160
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.920
What color is your egg?

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.700
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:48.740
Even if you say mean things,

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:52.590
I know you really love me.

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:56.260
Even if we fight a lot,

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:59.930
it's just 'cause we're always together.

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:02.990
Because you believe in me,

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:06.750
I can do anything!

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:13.050
And that's why I unlock my heart!

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.760
The person you want to be; things you want to say.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:22.420
Important things; things that are true.

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:26.130
Who you are; what you've yet to realize.

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:29.780
Mysterious things; happy things.

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:34.690
All of these things are inside your egg!

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:38.830
Pyon Pyon

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:39.980
Fumu Fumu

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:40.920
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.470
Howa Howa

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:43.680
Kira Kira

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:44.630
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:47.370
What color is your egg?

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:50.180
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:56.540 --> 00:02:00.210
Oh, Young Master. Have you returned?

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.430
I'm home.

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:11.430
To the Sky! Soaring Feelings!

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:11.430
Episode 56

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:14.970
Amu-chan.

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:20.310
I'm back, Amu-chan!

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:22.770
Nadeshiko!

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.510
There's only ten minutes of class left,

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:28.090
so could you please refrain from sleeping just a little while longer?

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:34.370
Balancing on a ball!  Yay, yay, yay!

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:37.770
You're yawning again.

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:39.270
Not getting enough sleep?

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:42.280
I had to listen to Ami's concert.

00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:46.620
Anyway, Tadase sure is late.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:51.140
Shoot, now I've done it.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.620
That boy's from another school, isn't he?

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:56.300
A trespasser? I'll call the police.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:02:59.950
Are you okay?

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:04.290
I wanted to go to the planetarium, but I seem to be lost.

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:06.590
To the planetarium?

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:07.660
Yeah.

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.960
He promised to show it to me.

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:13.970
Chairman's Office

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:14.340
Sorry for calling you here.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.850
No, it's fine.

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:19.990
But what does the Chairman want with me?

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:22.590
Please come in.

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:29.980
Fujisaki Nadeshiko!

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.770
It's been a while, Soma-kun.

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:34.940
So when did you get back to Japan?

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.020
Stop it, you'll mess up my hair!

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:41.480
Wait there a moment, I'm going to change.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:42.880
Change?

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:45.070
Please don't be too surprised.

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:50.910
Thanks for waiting.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:53.590
Uh, why are you wearing the boys' uniform?

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:56.090
That's his true appearance.

00:03:57.560 --> 00:04:00.890
My real name is Fujisaki Nagihiko.

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:03.560
I'm a 100% genuine boy.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:13.840
Up until now, Fujisaki-kun has acted like a girl as training for playing female roles in traditional dances.

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:15.750
Just a second...

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.660
Then that means...

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.280
And how did that...

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:24.150
Please don't think too hard about it. I'm the same person on the inside, after all.

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:27.780
Commoners certainly are slow to catch on.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:33.980
I called you here today, Kukai-kun, in order to help persuade Nagihiko-kun.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:38.210
As the former Jack's Chair, you can help create the new Jack.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.970
Chairman, that's...

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:45.850
Oh yeah, Sanjo was the Jack, but he transferred.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:50.730
Yes, and what's more, Easter has devised a new plot.

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:54.290
We can't leave the Jack's Chair empty forever.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:55.480
But I'm still-

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.770
Just do it. What's stopping you?

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:01.350
It'll be fun for the former Queen to be the Jack, right?

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:02.770
Fun?

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.710
Is there any way I can convince you?

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:08.970
That sparkle attack isn't going to work on me.

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:11.200
Come now, Nagihiko-kun.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.640
Isn't fun reason enough to do it?

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.600
You might find the answer in a place you don't expect.

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:22.210
Like the gem inside of a stone,

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.930
or the fated stars within stardust.

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:31.910
The answer which you seek may be hidden inside of this "fun," no?

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:36.640
I'm sorry for making you show me the way.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:40.560
It's okay, the resource wing is hard to find.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:42.730
Anyone who doesn't know where it is would get lost.

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:44.800
I'm Mizuno Mamoru.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:48.540
I'm Hinamori Amu. So you like planetariums?

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.130
I like space.

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.890
Or rather, I want to go there.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:56.350
To space? Why?

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.350
Every time I look at the sky,

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:02.580
I think about space, way up there.

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:07.520
How even after repeatedly failing, no matter how many years it took,

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:09.960
humans finally reached a place that high up.

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:12.690
People sure are amazing.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:17.050
I never thought of it that way.

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:18.850
Neither had I.

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:20.150
It's pretty amazing!

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.040
Romantic, isn't it?

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.340
You really know a lot about it, don't you, Mizuno-kun?

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:30.310
To the World of the Stars: Step by Step

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:30.310
I learned everything from this book.

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:31.690
Here.

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:35.600
Can I go to space, too?

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:37.350
Yeah.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:43.890
"To the World of the Stars: Step by Step," huh?

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:47.930
A great number of people are involved in space exploration.

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:51.880
Planners, the people in the control tower,

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:53.310
and the astronauts.

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:57.720
Everyone works together to go to space.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:00.830
And together, they overcome many different hardships.

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:07.830
So you want to become an astronaut, Mizuno-kun?

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:09.560
Well...

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.080
There's that Hinamori Amu again.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.860
Seiyo Academy.

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:20.850
I knew I'd heard of it somewhere.

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:23.000
She's with the target.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.150
What're we gonna do?

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:27.010
There's no need to panic.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:29.590
So where's the planetarium?

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:31.810
Um...

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.420
Don't tell us...

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:35.440
You're not lost, are you?

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:37.100
Bull's-eye!

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.270
As if!

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:40.990
It's that way!

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:44.540
Caretaker-san?

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:46.860
Good afternoon.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:49.030
You are Mizuno-kun, correct?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:51.640
Thank you for meeting with me.

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:52.890
Oh, it's my pleasure.

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:55.660
Come, the planetarium is over this way.

00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:58.880
Yep, you were lost.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:03.240
Please read that.

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:05.970
It's a report on the Guardians' recent activities.

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:08.670
Everyone is pressuring me into this.

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:10.830
You even made me wear the cape.

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:14.040
I might have to leave Japan again soon, you know.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:15.370
No worries!

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:16.770
And besides...

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:19.400
Now that I think about it, where's Temari today?

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:23.000
Temari's egg?

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.360
What's the matter?

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:27.060
Not even a greeting? How rude.

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:30.680
The reason I came back to Japan, you see,

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:34.090
is because I'm in a bit of a slump.

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:39.590
During my training to be a dancer, I felt that dancing alone is just such a tiny sliver of the world.

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:43.760
That's when Temari turned back into an egg,

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:47.760
and then a new egg was born.

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:49.760
Two eggs?

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:55.510
I don't know when either of them will hatch, or if they'll stay like this forever.

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:57.140
I see.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:09:00.390
Well, don't let it bother you too much.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.640
Why don't you say "hi" to Hinamori?

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:03.830
She'll be glad to see you.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:07.010
Well, about that...

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:11.540
The person Amu-chan wants to meet is Nadeshiko, not me.

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:12.930
No way.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.450
Amu-chan!

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:21.900
Nadeshiko.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:24.760
No, Nagihiko?

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:27.470
Long time no see! How've you been?

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:28.690
F-Fine.

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:30.220
So you knew about him?

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:33.430
You mean Nagihiko? Nadeshiko's older twin brother.

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:35.040
Twin?

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.580
Hey, why are you wearing our school uniform?

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:42.380
Have you transferred here?

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:44.930
But you're even wearing a Guardian's cape.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:49.860
That's right, Hinamori! You see, he's actually...

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:51.930
The new Jack's Chair!

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:54.340
No way!

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:55.260
For real?!

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:59.760
<i>Her</i> sparkle attack seems to work.

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:04.150
That's so great! We were totally useless without Kairi!

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:05.550
Uh, well...

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:07.540
Oh man, I have to tell everyone!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.300
I've gotta go!

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:11.180
O-Okay.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:14.360
What am I going to do?!

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.510
The new Jack is born!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:19.430
Huh? Nadeshiko had a twin brother?

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:20.900
I had no idea!

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:23.510
You kept it a secret, Amu! No fair!

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:25.180
Are you a Character Bearer, too, Nagi?

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.430
What is he like-dechu?

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.870
He hasn't hatched yet.

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.890
It's a different color than Temari's.

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:34.340
Even the Guardian Characters are twins.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:36.370
Who is this Nadeshiko person?

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:38.830
She was the previous Queen's Chair.

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:41.670
New Jack.

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:45.540
Can you even be a Guardian without a Guardian Character?

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.100
Um, well...

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:51.360
It'll be okay! After all, Fujisaki-kun used to be the Qu-

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:54.390
What did you say, King? Your cheeks itch?

00:10:57.370 --> 00:11:00.480
You really do look just like Nadeshiko.

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:06.300
Nadeshiko is current studying abroad, you see, but she was Amu-chi's best friend in her class.

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:07.600
Best friend?

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:12.530
I'm also the Queen's Chair,

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:14.640
and in the same class.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:18.250
Why am I not your best friend?

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:19.160
Rima!

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:21.850
Don't worry. She's just faking it.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:24.000
How did you know?

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.880
I'm quite good at theatrics.

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:29.850
Anyway, it's nice to meet you, Rima-chan.

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.350
Hey.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:35.230
Amu, don't get too close to that guy.

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:37.390
I can't trust him for some reason.

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:39.330
Oh dear, this might be a problem.

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:55.270
It's got to be rose tea in the afternoon, you know?

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:57.680
And uiro for a snack, of course!

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:57.680
Uiro is a special treat from Nagoya, similar to mochi.

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:01.310
Hurry up and come out.

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:05.900
I'm sure I can take an excellent egg from you.

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:11.060
Hey, what's the matter now, new Jack?

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:14.530
Nagi, don't let Kukai beat you!

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:18.330
Are Jacks only good at messing around?

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:20.170
Amu-chan!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:21.310
What is it?

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:24.500
I sense the presence of that same Guardian Character over there.

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:25.800
You're right!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:29.920
I bet Lulu-chan came to see Amu-chan!

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:36.510
So why, exactly, do I have to go see her?

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:44.060
You really are a bother, aren't you?

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:47.610
I understand how much you look up to me,

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:50.060
but will you please stop stalking me?

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:53.100
Huh? What's that supposed to mean?

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:57.200
You realize this is <i>my</i> school, right? What do you think you're doing here?

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.790
I've no need to tell you anything.

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:03.890
After all, it's not like we're friends or anything.

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:06.370
If you'll excuse me.

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:10.150
I don't think it's possible for us to like her.

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:12.600
Until we meet again!

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:17.540
That there was close!

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:18.970
I won't let her interfere.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:25.040
Yeah, I should definitely be an astronaut.

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:27.110
But I'm bad at sports.

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.910
Maybe I should study to be a planner?

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:32.430
But I really do want to try going to space.

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:37.930
You are lost, aren't you?

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:41.540
It'll be fine as long as you go to space, right?

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:42.940
In that case,

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:46.180
don't take the boring way and get there step by step.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:49.510
You should just blast off and go all at once!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:14:01.060
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:03.970
? Character Change.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:06.820
What the heck's wrong with her?

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:10.150
As if I'd ever look up to her!

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:12.220
Amu-chan, look!

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:14.570
Mizuno-kun?

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:20.990
It's a ? Egg!

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:22.410
? Egg?

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:23.730
That's right.

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:25.630
All I need to do is fly there.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.060
I'm going

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.890
to space!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:34.640
Oh no!

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:45.310
Character Transformation: Space Dream!

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:47.180
Prepare for launch!

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:50.110
Blast off!

00:14:57.770 --> 00:14:58.550
Amu!

00:14:58.550 --> 00:14:59.060
Right!

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:01.100
Let's go, everybody!

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:02.060
Yeah!

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:06.050
My heart:

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.510
My heart:

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:08.920
My heart:

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:10.540
My heart:

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:11.930
My heart:

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:13.400
Unlock!

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.720
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:46.910
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:50.470
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.970
Character Transformation: Sky Jack!

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:57.630
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:02.920
Nagihiko, we're off!

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:03.930
See you.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.140
Blast off!

00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:25.470
Fly, fly!

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:28.860
Yes, that's it. Blast off all you want.

00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:31.010
Get a move on! Get to it!

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:35.850
Mizuno-kun!

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:37.640
He's so high up!

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:40.010
Well then, let me take care of this!

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:42.530
Let's go!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.630
Don't get in my way!

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.900
My board!

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:03.390
Blast off!

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:12.540
Amu-chan!

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:14.180
Just a little bit farther.

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:21.280
Amu-chan!

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:22.100
Amu!

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:27.980
You can't even fly.

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:30.410
A rocket?

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:41.220
Fire the rocket!

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:43.120
Prepare for launch!

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:45.020
If this goes on, the playground...

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:45.950
Rima-chan!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:49.030
Tightrope Dancer!

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:50.340
Why that?

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:52.180
I get it! Mashiro-san!

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:57.100
Tightrope Dancer!

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:58.680
Yaya-chan, your turn!

00:17:58.680 --> 00:17:59.600
Roger!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:03.060
Go Go Little Duckies!

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:15.060
That's our Nagihiko!

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.470
Lift-off!

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:30.050
Ran, let's try one more time!

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:30.930
Right!

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:35.220
It's pointless.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:36.950
Must reach him.

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:38.640
Must reach him.

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:39.810
Reach him!

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:53.100
Heart Speeders!

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:01.070
Wow, Amu-chan!

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.860
This is...

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:04.910
My new power!

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.110
Hinamori-san.

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:09.850
Amu-chan truly is incredible.

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:14.240
You think you can beat my rockets?

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:23.630
I'll get to space with my own power!

00:19:23.630 --> 00:19:26.070
I'll show you I can fly there myself!

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:28.560
That's wrong! You're mistaken!

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:35.310
Rima-chan!

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:38.470
Didn't you say it yourself, Mizuno-kun?

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:41.520
You said that everyone worked together!

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.250
Everyone worked together to get to space!

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:46.210
Everyone...

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:52.790
Astronauts go to space together, taking with them everyone's hopes and feelings.

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:55.360
See for yourself.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.560
Space is so vast.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:03.650
So even if one person's step is small,

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:05.990
with a hundred people, that's a hundred steps.

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:08.290
With a thousand people, that's a thousand steps.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.510
And it's those footsteps we build upon.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:12.420
Everyone gets there

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.400
step by step.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.220
I...

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:33.030
Amu-chan!

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:34.100
Right.

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:37.360
Negative Heart:

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:38.160
Lock On!

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:44.600
Open Heart!

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:11.480
That dagblasit Embryo didn't show up!

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:14.010
There'll always be a next time.

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:20.910
A dream?

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:23.850
Hinamori-san?

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:25.850
Thank goodness, you're awake.

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:28.250
Here.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.590
This is your book, right?

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:36.430
It's okay if it's just something small.

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:39.320
I'll head toward space,

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:40.810
step by step.

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:45.810
Good job, everyone!

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:49.010
With Nagi here, everything's working great!

00:21:49.010 --> 00:21:50.060
You think?

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:51.870
You did great, too, Hinamori!

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:54.910
Hey now, Kukai, stop it already!

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:58.040
Fujisaki-kun, you really helped us today.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:01.110
It's only natural as one of the Guardians.

00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:03.180
Even without a Guardian Character.

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:08.870
I guess I have no choice but to allow you to be the Jack.

00:22:08.870 --> 00:22:09.760
But...

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:13.390
No getting close to Amu!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.170
Come on, Rima.

00:22:15.170 --> 00:22:16.510
Rima, are you jealous?

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:23.450
(For real?)

00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:26.190
(Eh?)

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:28.400
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:31.120
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:36.600
If we ended up becoming adults today, {kyou mo}

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:41.230
I bet we'd lose sight of everything except what's in front of us. {kitto}

00:22:41.230 --> 00:22:42.570
Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:47.500
So I wonder what we've been {kyoumade}

00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:52.140
so engrossed with finding all this time. {honto}

00:22:52.140 --> 00:22:53.400
Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:55.130
Someone once said: {dare ga}

00:22:55.130 --> 00:22:58.040
"We were born to be happy, {shiawase}

00:22:58.040 --> 00:23:04.000
so let's live to make others happy!" {soshite}

00:23:05.630 --> 00:23:06.780
How long will I have to  {dore kurai}

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:08.480
carry all this love in my heart?  {mune ippai}

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:09.530
How long will I have to {dore kurai}

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:11.150
carry all this love in my heart?  {mune ippai}

00:23:11.150 --> 00:23:16.660
I wonder when I'll be able to let it all out. {kakaetara}

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:17.660
How many of {dore kurai}

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:19.310
all those days in my heart...  {mune ippai}

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:20.370
How many of{dore kurai}

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:22.130
all those days in my heart...  {mune ippai}

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:27.540
How many of them have we run through? {ano hi}

00:23:27.540 --> 00:23:28.590
With this much love {kore kurai}

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:30.280
filling my heart...  {mune ippai}

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:31.370
With this much love{kore kurai}

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:32.950
filling my heart... {mune ippai}

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:35.670
I hugged you tightly, {kimi wo}

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:41.210
and during that time, we both felt so much happiness. {futari}

00:23:41.210 --> 00:23:43.390
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:43.390 --> 00:23:43.890
(Why?)

00:23:43.890 --> 00:23:46.080
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:48.880
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:50.190
(Phew...)

00:23:50.180 --> 00:23:53.550
Amu-chan, isn't it great that a new Jack's been chosen?

00:23:53.550 --> 00:23:56.860
Yeah! And it's even Nadeshiko's twin brother, Nagihiko!

00:23:56.860 --> 00:23:59.170
Something tells me this is going to be fun!

00:24:01.070 --> 00:24:02.750
What's the matter, Miki?

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:04.370
I can feel something.

00:24:04.370 --> 00:24:05.290
Feel something?

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:07.910
A new Guardian Character?

00:24:07.910 --> 00:24:10.210
No! This feeling is...

00:24:10.210 --> 00:24:12.340
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.340 --> 00:24:13.850
Fists of the Ultra-Cute!

00:24:13.850 --> 00:24:14.760
This is bad!

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:17.270
This feeling tells me you're in danger, Amu-chan!

00:24:17.270 --> 00:24:19.380
What?! For real?!
